# Eval run outputs. The receipts, the raw judge output and the generated
# EVAL-LOG.md are local forensics: bulky, and they carry candid commentary and
# failing baselines that a shipped bundle should not distribute. The plugin
# manifests ship the repo root, so none of it is safe to track. Record the scores
# that stood at PR time in the PR description instead.
skills/*/evals/receipts/
EVAL-LOG.md
